# Agent scratch reports (forensics / inventory passes). Dot-prefixed working notes
# left in the worktree so a session can re-read them; what they ESTABLISH belongs in
# the spec headers, docs/dev/autotest-status.md, the roadmap and the todo entries,
# which is where a reader looks. Ignored because `git add -A` swept them into two
# commits in one night before this line existed.
/.forensics-*.md
/.inventory-*.md
